     69  0e6e							; ---- presses: down now, not accepted yet. Two passes: modifiers (SHIFT,
     70  0e6e							; CTRL, K) first, so SHIFT+F7 or K + a note pressed in the same scan
     71  0e6e							; still count as a combination.
