------- FILE main.asm
------- FILE bend.asm LEVEL 2 PASS 3
      0  2470					      include	"bend.asm"
      1  2470							; Fat Chip 64 - bends (SPACE / the keytar's buttons and wheel), v0.13
      2  2470							;
      3  2470							; What everything is bent by: m = 0-192 sixteenths of a semitone (an octave
      4  2470							; at most), up or down (bendMag, bendUp), from three things added together:
      5  2470							;   the BEND DOWN / BEND UP actions (SPACE or a keytar button, held): bendLvl
      6  2470							;     0-255 ramps up over about 1 s while held, back over about 0.5 s; full =
      7  2470							;     the menu's BEND RANGE (1-12 semitones, default 2)
      8  2470							;   the keytar's wheel: wheelMag 0-255 up or down, full = BEND RANGE
      9  2470							;   VINYL STOP (held): vinylLvl 0-255 the same way, like a record stopping:
     10  2470							;     speed (256 - lvl) / 256, the pitch 12 log2(1 / speed) down (vinPitch:
     11  2470							;     an octave by lvl 128). The SID keeps on down a second octave (vinSid)
     12  2470							;     and fades out from lvl 192; the beat and arp slow (up to 8x); at lvl
     13  2470							;     248 everything has stopped: silent, no drums (vinylCut). Let go, it
     14  2470							;     winds back up in 0.5 s.
     15  2470							; Then:
     16  2470							;   SID       its frequency x 2^(+-m/192), from tables (bendtab.asm)
     17  2470							;   Game Boy  bend range 12 (CC 85, sent with the sound), bend = 8192 +- m x 8192 / 192
     18  2470							;   MidiNES   p(n) x the table / 8192 for the triangle, twice for the pulses
     19  2470							;	       (p = the MidiNES triangle bend scale, 1710 at MIDI 36); notes
     20  2470							;	       without room at the bottom of the NES range don't bend down.
     21  2470							; Bends go out every BEND_TICK ms at most, and before each new NES note.
     22  2470
     23  2470							; , : SPACE's action back
     24  2470				   SpaceBack
     25  2470					      subroutine
     26  2470		       ae d4 c3 	      ldx	spaceAct
